sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Copy as copy warp
  participant Ready as base/correction ready[2]
  participant MMA as MMA warp
  participant Compute as compute + BF16 state
  participant Free as base/correction free[2]
  Note over Copy,Free: 初始化两槽和完成 barrier；预取 chunk 0 到槽 0
  loop chunk j = 0..255
    Copy->>Free: 复用 next=(j+1)%2 前等上次 free phase
    Copy->>Ready: 若 j+1<256，TMA 预取 base/query B(j+1)
    MMA->>Compute: 等待 carried state 当前 phase
    MMA->>Ready: 等 base ready[j%2]，phase=(j//2)%2
    MMA->>Free: 消费 base B(j)，提交本槽 free
    MMA->>Compute: 发布 base/query 完成
    Compute->>Compute: RHS、前代入、BF16 U 发布
    Copy->>Ready: 若 j+1<256，TMA 预取 correction/output B(j+1)
    MMA->>Ready: 等 correction ready[j%2]，同一槽 phase
    MMA->>Free: 消费 correction B(j)，提交本槽 free
    MMA->>Compute: 发布 correction/output 完成
    Compute->>Compute: 输出和旧状态合并，发布下一 BF16 state
  end
  Note over Copy,Free: 最后排空两槽，失效 mbarrier；final state 只在末块写回
